              <path d="M8.4 12.2l2.5 2.5 4.7-5.2" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
            </svg>
          </span>
          <span class="av-pro-badge__text"><strong>Recommended</strong> by Occupational Therapists</span>
        </div>

        <ul class="av-checks">
          <li><svg class="av-checks__ico" aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="12" fill="currentColor"/><path d="M7.5 12.5l3 3 6-6.5" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> A second handle to help you stand up effortlessly</li>
          <li><svg class="av-checks__ico" aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="12" fill="currentColor"/><path d="M7.5 12.5l3 3 6-6.5" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> Stable on every surface</li>
