            <span class="av-trust__item"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="15" height="15" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M1 8h13v9H1z"/><path d="M14 11h4l3 3v3h-7"/><circle cx="6" cy="19" r="1.8"/><circle cx="17" cy="19" r="1.8"/></svg> Free shipping</span>
          </p>
          <p class="av-trust__delivery">Delivered between <strong data-av-ship-from>—</strong> and <strong data-av-ship-to>—</strong></p>
        </div>
        <script>
          (function () {
            var months = ['January','February','March','April','May','June','July','August','September','October','November','December'];
            function fmt(d) { return months[d.getMonth()] + ' ' + d.getDate(); }
            var a = new Date(); a.setDate(a.getDate() + 3);
            var b = new Date(); b.setDate(b.getDate() + 4);
            document.querySelectorAll('[data-av-ship-from]').forEach(function (el) { el.textContent = fmt(a); });
            document.querySelectorAll('[data-av-ship-to]').forEach(function (el) { el.textContent = fmt(b); });
          })();
        </script>

        {%- comment -%} ----- Accordions ----- {%- endcomment -%}
        <div class="av-acc-group">
          <details class="av-acc">
            <summary><span class="av-acc__ico" aria-hidden="true">ⓘ</span> Frequently Asked Questions</summary>
            <div class="av-acc__body">
              <p><strong>How high does the cane adjust?</strong><br>The WalkWise cane adjusts from 85 cm to 98 cm, which suits people roughly between 1.55 m and 1.85 m tall.</p>
              <p><strong>How is the flashlight powered?</strong><br>The light runs on 2 AAA batteries.</p>
              <p><strong>Is it lightweight?</strong><br>Yes! The WalkWise cane was designed to be light and easy to carry — it weighs less than 450 g.</p>
              <p><strong>What is the maximum weight the cane supports?</strong><br>The WalkWise cane supports up to 115 kg.</p>
              <p><strong>Does the cane fold for travel or easy storage?</strong><br>Yes, the WalkWise cane is foldable and stores easily in a bag or in the car trunk.</p>
              <p><strong>Can it be used by both right- and left-handed people?</strong><br>Yes, its symmetrical design works equally well for the right or left hand.</p>
            </div>
          </details>
          <details class="av-acc">
            <summary><span class="av-acc__ico" aria-hidden="true">✎</span> How to use</summary>
            <div class="av-acc__body">
              <p><strong>1. Adjust the height</strong><br>Press the side button and adjust the cane until the handle reaches your wrist with your arm extended. Release to lock.</p>
              <p><strong>2. Get up from the sofa or bed</strong><br>Place your hand on the lower handle (the second handle), push to lift yourself up, then grab the main handle to walk.</p>
              <p><strong>3. Insert 2 AAA batteries, then turn on the light</strong><br>Press the light button to illuminate your path. Ideal for moving around at night.</p>
              <p><strong>4. Use the alarm</strong><br>When needed, press the red button to trigger the alarm and alert those around you.</p>
              <p><strong>5. Fold the cane</strong><br>Press the folding buttons and fold the sections. Compact and easy to store or carry.</p>
            </div>
          </details>
          <details class="av-acc">
            <summary><span class="av-acc__ico" aria-hidden="true">✔</span> 60-Day Money-Back Guarantee</summary>
            <div class="av-acc__body">
              <p>At WalkWise, your satisfaction is our top priority. We do everything we can to give you an experience that meets your expectations. That's why we offer a 60-day money-back guarantee — no questions, no hassle. If for any reason you are not completely satisfied with your purchase, we commit to refunding you in full. Your trust means everything to us.</p>
            </div>
          </details>
          <details class="av-acc">
            <summary><span class="av-acc__ico" aria-hidden="true">🚚</span> Shipping &amp; returns</summary>
            <div class="av-acc__body">
              <p>We work fast to ship your order within 48 hours. Once your order has shipped, you'll receive an email with additional information including your tracking number so you can follow your parcel.</p>
              <p>Delivery times vary depending on your location. The average time is 5 to 9 business days.</p>
            </div>
          </details>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  {%- comment -%} ========== Press marquee ========== {%- endcomment -%}
  <section class="av-press" aria-label="As featured in">
    <div class="av-marquee">
      <div class="av-marquee__track">
        {%- assign press = section.settings.press_logos | split: ',' -%}
        {%- for i in (1..4) -%}
          {%- for logo in press -%}
            <span class="av-press__logo"><img src="{{ logo | strip }}" alt="" loading="lazy"></span>
          {%- endfor -%}
        {%- endfor -%}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

